dedModule":"SwiftUICore","modules":[{"name":"Swami","relatedModules":["SwiftUICore"]}],"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Inherited from ","type":"text"},{"code":"View.fileDialogMessage(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/fileDialogMessage(_:)-9pb68","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/filedialogmessage(_:)-9pb68"]}],"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/fileDialogMessage(_:)-9pb68":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/filedialogmessage(_:)-9pb68","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"fileDialogMessage(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fileDialogMessage","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/fileDialogMessage(_:)-9pb68"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"title":"Interaction_DragView","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"code":"Position","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"title":"Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"kind":"symbol"}}}